  "releaseNotes": "Adds webhook scopes and disconnect support for ZoHo integrations.\n      - Adds Desk.webhooks scope generation through ZoDeskPermissions\n      - Adds optional token deletion support for durable token stores\n      - Improves tenant disconnect flows through ZoHoTokenManager.ForgetAsync\n      - Preserves existing token store compatibility with an optional deletion interface",
